---
// UavComplianceSection.astro
// Entity cluster: EN 10204 3.1 MTR + Metallurgical Uniformity + Material Traceability
// Technical depth: Non-void verification, airborne component certification
---
<section class="relative py-24 overflow-hidden" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 2%, var(--theme-bg));">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.02]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px, var(--theme-primary) 1px, transparent 0); background-size: 40px 40px;"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 mb-4 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full border" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 10%, transparent); border-color: var(--theme-primary); color: var(--theme-primary);">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z" /></svg>
        Material Certification
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6" style="color: var(--theme-text);">
        100% <span style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Material Traceability</span> — EN 10204 3.1 MTR &amp; Metallurgical Uniformity for Airborne Components
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 65%, transparent);">
        Every UAV component is backed by EN 10204 3.1 Mill Test Reports certifying chemical composition and mechanical properties — ensuring no metallurgical voids, inclusions, or impurities exist within high-stress structural nodes subjected to flight loads.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">
        <div class="p-6">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 12%, transparent);">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 14.25v-2.625a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375h-1.5A1.125 1.125 0 0113.5 7.125v-1.5a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375H8.25m0 12.75h7.5m-7.5 3H12M10.5 2.25H5.625c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v17.25c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h12.75c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V11.25a9 9 0 00-9-9z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--theme-text);">EN 10204 3.1 Mill Test Reports</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 60%, transparent);">
            Every batch of Grade 5 Titanium (Ti-6Al-4V) is certified with EN 10204 Type 3.1 documentation — verifying chemical composition, tensile strength, yield strength, elongation, and reduction of area. Reports are retained digitally for 10+ years, fully traceable to each manufactured component.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-start text-xs" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 65%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>Grade 5 Ti-6Al-4V: tensile ≥ 900 MPa, yield ≥ 830 MPa, elongation ≥ 10%</li>
            <li class="flex items-start text-xs" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 65%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>Ultrasonic inspection available — verifies no internal voids or inclusions in critical flight hardware</li>
            <li class="flex items-start text-xs" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 65%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>10+ year digital archival of mill certs — fully retrievable for customer audit</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">
        <div class="p-6">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 12%, transparent);">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.568 3H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 003 5.25v4.318c0 .597.237 1.17.659 1.591l9.581 9.581c.699.699 1.78.872 2.607.33a18.095 18.095 0 005.223-5.223c.542-.827.369-1.908-.33-2.607L11.16 3.66A2.25 2.25 0 009.568 3z" /><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 6h.008v.008H6V6z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--theme-text);">CMM Dimensional Validation</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 60%, transparent);">
            All UAV structural components receive CMM dimensional inspection per engineering drawings — with ZEISS CMM platforms achieving ±1.9 µm volumetric accuracy. GD&T callouts including concentricity, true position, profile, and runout are verified for every feature critical to flight safety.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-start text-xs" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 65%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>ZEISS CMM ±1.9 µm accuracy — ISO 17025 traceable calibration</li>
            <li class="flex items-start text-xs" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 65%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>GD&T per ASME Y14.5 — concentricity, true position, profile, runout verification</li>
            <li class="flex items-start text-xs" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 65%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>Full dimensional report delivered with each lot — traceable to individual serial number</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 50%, transparent);">
      <span class="font-semibold" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Entity Cluster:</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">EN 10204 3.1 MTR</span>
      <span class="text-xs">+</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">Metallurgical Uniformity</span>
      <span class="text-xs">+</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">Ultrasonic Inspection</span>
      <span class="text-xs">+</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">CMM Validation</span>
      <span class="text-xs">+</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">ASME Y14.5 GD&T</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
